,"start":26,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"panlu-q-483fdeab865a613cf392","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-78bab0d8e040015b3032","layer":"original","quote":"濬求朝诣建业，欲尽辞极谏。至，闻太子登已数言之而不见从；濬乃大请百僚，欲因会手刃杀壹；以身当之，为国除患。壹密闻知，称疾不行","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"panlu-q-aaea82ba24f349cf41ff","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-f85512dd7dfcbb61c6b3","layer":"original","quote":"濬每进见，无不陈壹之奸险也。由此壹宠渐衰，后遂诛戮","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"panlu-q-b2d25a9519d4ab58d7cb","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-55337a59319992546fa6","layer":"original","quote":"时校事吕壹，操弄威柄，奏按丞相顾雍、左将军朱据等：皆见禁止","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":26,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"panlu-q-bef1c618302df19e00ed","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-55337a59319992546fa6","layer":"original","quote":"黄门侍郎谢厷，语次问壹〖2〗：“顾公事何如？”壹答：“不能佳。”厷又问：“若此公免退，谁当代之？”壹未答厷。厷曰：“得无潘太常得之乎〖3〗？”壹良久曰：“君语近之也。”厷谓曰：“潘太常，常切齿于君，但道远无因耳〖4〗。今日代顾公，恐明日便击君矣〖5〗！”壹大惧，遂解散雍事","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":26,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":33,"end":169,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-45b76b060b964c7ea6f1","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-ee93699dac12389e55ea","layer":"pei","quote":"数月，壹被诛","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b67c177f97871b035fb2","start":127,"end":133,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shiyi-q-3cfc168d09fd5b39e294","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-a1f93cc44934f08efa45","layer":"original","quote":"典校郎吕壹，诬白故江夏太守刁嘉谤讪国政〖3〗；权怒，收嘉系狱，悉验问〖4〗。时同坐人皆怖畏壹，并言闻之；仪独云“无闻”。于是见穷诘累日〖5〗，诏旨转厉；群臣为之屏息〖6〗。仪对曰：“今刀锯已在臣颈，臣何敢为嘉隐讳？自取夷灭，为不忠之鬼！顾以闻知当有本末〖7〗。”据实答问，辞不倾移。权遂舍之，嘉亦得免。﹝一﹞","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":154,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o124a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-cb04850995ccd20536ba","layer":"original","quote":"初，权信任校事吕壹〖6〗。壹性苛惨〖7〗，用法深刻〖8〗。太子登数谏，权不纳，大臣由是莫敢言。后壹奸罪发露，伏诛。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":123,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-p059b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-2fcac46deecf90721482","layer":"pei","quote":"胄，其少子，有文武姿局，少知名。举贤良，稍迁建安太守。吕壹宾客于郡犯法，胄收付狱，考竟。壹怀恨，后密谮胄。权大怒，召胄还。潘濬、陈表并为请，得释。","attribution":"《文士传》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-436f44c3434f84aa19b6","start":55,"end":128,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o124","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-cb04850995ccd20536ba","layer":"original","quote":"初，权信任校事吕壹〖6〗。壹性苛惨〖7〗，用法深刻〖8〗。太子登数谏，权不纳，大臣由是莫敢言。后壹奸罪发露，伏诛。权引咎责躬〖9〗；乃使中书郎袁礼告谢诸大将〖10〗，因问时事所当损益。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":123,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-p059","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-2fcac46deecf90721482","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《文士传》曰：“胄字敬先，沛国人。父札，才学博达。权为骠骑将军，以札为从事中郎。与张昭、孙邵，共定朝仪。胄，其少子，有文武姿局，少知名。举贤良，稍迁建安太守。吕壹宾客于郡犯法，胄收付狱，考竟。壹怀恨，后密谮胄。权大怒，召胄还。潘濬、陈表并为请，得释。后拜宣信校尉，往救公孙渊；已为魏所破，还，迁执金吾。子丰，字曼季。有文学操行，与陆云善，与云诗（词）〔相〕往反。司空张华辟，未就，卒。”","attribution":"《文士传》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-436f44c3434f84aa19b6","start":0,"end":196,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-090d476f9db76bae7762","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-fceaee12582b0a667943","layer":"original","quote":"典校吕壹疑据实取〖7〗，考问主者〖8〗，死于杖下","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":471,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-6a8f372561716f54634b","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-fceaee12582b0a667943","layer":"original","quote":"嘉禾中，始铸大钱，一当五百。后据部曲应受三万缗〖5〗，工王遂诈而受之〖6〗。典校吕壹疑据实取〖7〗，考问主者〖8〗，死于杖下；据哀其无辜，厚棺敛之。壹又表“据吏为据隐，故厚其殡”。权数责问据，据无以自明，藉草待罪〖9〗。数月，典军吏刘助觉〖10〗，言王遂所取。权大感悟，曰：“朱据见枉，况吏民乎？”乃穷治壹罪，赏助百万。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":471,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":160,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-a89bd893eddbffe759b8","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-fceaee12582b0a667943","layer":"original","quote":"壹又表“据吏为据隐，故厚其殡","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":471,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":74,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-ec26171254eb0e4bff28","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-fceaee12582b0a667943","layer":"original","quote":"权大感悟，曰：“朱据见枉，况吏民乎？”乃穷治壹罪，赏助百万","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":471,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":130,"end":159,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-6dbd310ab787e09ad8fb","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-3d05dd7066ef22ad64b5","layer":"original","quote":"及吕壹诛，权又有诏切磋瑾等〖3〗。语在《权传》","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":312,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-7d4e90c7af002ba897e6","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-e13bf0a091cac44e124f","layer":"original","quote":"久之，吕壹、秦博为中书〖6〗，典校诸官府及州郡文书〖7〗。壹等因此渐作威福，遂造作榷酤障管之利〖8〗；举罪纠奸，纤介必闻〖9〗；重以深案丑诬〖10〗，毁短大臣，排陷无辜。雍等皆见举白〖11〗，用被谴让","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-8ff0de7d4521cfc25a72","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-be0e6ba00e02679cc156","layer":"original","quote":"后中书吕壹典校文书，多所纠举。骘上疏曰：“伏闻诸典校擿抉细微〖1〗，吹毛求瑕；重案深诬，辄欲陷人以成威福。无罪无辜，横受大刑；是以使民跼天蹐地〖2〗，谁不战栗？昔之狱官，惟贤是任；故皋陶作士〖3〗，吕侯赎刑〖4〗，张、于廷尉〖5〗：民无冤枉。休泰之祚，实由此兴。今之小臣，动与古异〖6〗；狱以贿成，轻忽人命；归咎于上，为国速怨〖7〗。夫一人吁嗟〖8〗，王道为亏，甚可仇疾；明德慎罚〖9〗，哲人惟刑〖10〗，书传所美。自今蔽狱〖11〗，都下则宜咨顾雍〖12〗；武昌则陆逊、潘濬。平心专意，务在得情。骘党神明〖13〗，受罪何恨！”","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":418,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":263,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-963ec956fb4ceb6b3c57","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-768cf7a650822144fd92","layer":"pei","quote":"徐众评曰：“雍不以吕壹见毁之故，而和颜悦色，诚长者矣；然开引其意，问所欲道，此非也。壹奸险乱法，毁伤忠贤，吴国寒心；自太子登、陆逊以下，切谏不能得；是以潘濬欲因会，手剑之，以除国患，疾恶忠主，义形于色。而今乃发起令言，若壹称枉邪：不申理，则非录狱本旨；若承辞而奏之，吴主傥以敬丞相所言，而复原宥，伯言、承明不当悲慨哉！怀叙本无私恨，无所为嫌；故詈辱之，疾恶意耳：恶不仁者，其为仁也。季武子死，曾点倚其门而歌；子皙创发，子产催令自裁。以此言之，雍不当责怀叙也。”","attribution":"裴注·徐众评","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c5f62508b513eb563318","start":0,"end":230,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-ac63164db98346ad9e5a","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-e13bf0a091cac44e124f","layer":"original","quote":"后壹奸罪发露，收系廷尉。雍往断狱，壹以囚见；雍和颜色，问其辞状。临出，又谓壹曰：“君意得无欲有所道〖13〗？”壹叩头无言。时尚书郎怀叙，面詈辱壹〖14〗；雍责叙曰：“官有正法，何至于此","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":105,"end":197,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-ca8368a8285393a3fdf3","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-fc94f8a24f75d775c4b2","layer":"original","quote":"权亦觉悟，遂诛吕壹。骘前后荐达屈滞〖26〗，救解患难，书数十上。权虽不能悉纳，然时采其言，多蒙济赖","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":422,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-5e9bed0855ae724b8f71","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-c54068771c5b07e0f17d","layer":"original","quote":"初，以吕壹奸罪发闻，有司穷治，奏以大辟；或以为“宜加焚裂〖13〗，用彰元恶”。权以访泽，泽曰：“盛明之世，不宜复有此刑。”权从之。又诸官司有所患疾〖14〗，欲增重科防〖15〗，以检御臣下〖16〗；泽每曰“宜依礼、律”：其和而有正，皆此类也。﹝一﹞","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":124,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-98d51197c8733d79f994","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-c54068771c5b07e0f17d","layer":"original","quote":"初，以吕壹奸罪发闻，有司穷治，奏以大辟","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":124,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
